@* The catch-up after the page comes back to the foreground. Recette R2-061 (2026-10-02, user decision):
   a full veil with the animated plane and "Synchronisation en cours…", instead of the small notification
   at the bottom of the screen, so nobody reads or clicks a page that is not current yet. It lifts as soon
   as the catch-up ends (or after RealtimeSyncStatus.SafetyTimeout). The connection-lost overlay wins
   whenever it is up. *@
@if (Visible)
{
    <div class="realtime-sync-indicator" data-testid="realtime-sync-indicator" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-busy="true">
        <div class="realtime-sync-card">
            <AetheusLoader Size="OmniControlSize.Large" />
            <OmniText Element="OmniTextElement.Paragraph" Class="omni-u-m-0 realtime-sync-text">@L["RealtimeSyncInProgress"]</OmniText>
        </div>
    </div>
}
